{
  "acquisition_method": "Read-only public GitHub REST metadata and raw.githubusercontent.com URLs fetched by curl as inert bytes. Own trusted Python stdlib bookkeeping only. Every staged raw source/license Git blob SHA-1 was verified against exact upstream tree/commit metadata; all staged files also receive SHA-256 hashes. No target execution or remote mutation.",
